# .git is intentionally NOT ignored: the Docker builds derive the app build
# version from `git rev-parse HEAD` so the UpdateAvailableBanner can detect a
# new deploy. Both images compute the SAME commit, so they agree within a deploy
# and only differ across deploys. (.git only ever lives in throwaway build
# stages — it never ships in the final nginx/runtime images.)
